1
00:00:06,417 --> 00:00:09,194
Amara: Grandpa! The wind is perfect today!

2
00:00:09,625 --> 00:00:13,168
Idris: Then let's wake up Grandma's old dragon kite.

3
00:00:14,458 --> 00:00:15,899
Amara: Look how high it goes!

4
00:00:19,083 --> 00:00:22,072
Amara: No... the string broke. It's gone!

5
00:00:24,417 --> 00:00:28,464
Teo: Hey, don't cry. Kites can't fly far without wind.

6
00:00:28,917 --> 00:00:31,369
Teo: Come on. We'll find it together.

7
00:00:36,958 --> 00:00:39,360
Noor: Is this little dragon looking for someone?

8
00:00:39,625 --> 00:00:41,621
Amara: Our kite! You found it!

9
00:00:41,958 --> 00:00:43,699
Noor: It landed in my lemon tree.

10
00:00:44,042 --> 00:00:47,284
Rosa: Good things find their way back to kind hearts.

11
00:00:47,542 --> 00:00:49,988
Idris: Same time tomorrow, neighbour?

